      "updated": 1790058261576,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Components of AI Assistant \n\n1. semantic search engine\n   - Vector store\n   - retriever\n   - document reranking\n   - document loaders\n   - indexers\n   - document parsers\n   - embeddings models\n\n2. Tools\n\n   - Tavaly (Search the web)\n   - Search in our PostGres DB\n   \n\n3. Langgraph & Langchain\n\n   - Routing\n   - Memory [long and short]\n   - streaming\n   - tools Calling\n ",
      "fontSize": 37.862902426181854,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Components of AI Assistant \n\n1. semantic search engine\n   - Vector store\n   - retriever\n   - document reranking\n   - document loaders\n   - indexers\n   - document parsers\n   - embeddings models\n\n2. Tools\n\n   - Tavaly (Search the web)\n   - Search in our PostGres DB\n   \n\n3. Langgraph & Langchain\n\n   - Routing\n   - Memory [long and short]\n   - streaming\n   - tools Calling\n ",
