      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790058261588,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So, once an Event is Triggered, an automation system \nruns the next steps in the workflow. These are called actions node ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So, once an Event is Triggered, an automation system \nruns the next steps in the workflow. These are called actions node ",
