      "updated": 1790058261589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Learn langchain V1 from Scratch\n\n- ChatModels\n- Embedding Models,RAG, Vector Data\n- Multi-Agent system\n- Build RAG Agent as Exercise\n\n2. Install Nextjs App and build  Auth\n   \n   - Next Auth   \n\n3. Project Page \n4. Learn React flow From Scratch\n5. Workflow Page\n6. Node Creation\n7. Integration\n   - Gmail\n   - sheet\n   - Drive\n   - Notion\n   - Slack\n8. Integrate LangChain in NextJs\n9. Agent Creation",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Learn langchain V1 from Scratch\n\n- ChatModels\n- Embedding Models,RAG, Vector Data\n- Multi-Agent system\n- Build RAG Agent as Exercise\n\n2. Install Nextjs App and build  Auth\n   \n   - Next Auth   \n\n3. Project Page \n4. Learn React flow From Scratch\n5. Workflow Page\n6. Node Creation\n7. Integration\n   - Gmail\n   - sheet\n   - Drive\n   - Notion\n   - Slack\n8. Integrate LangChain in NextJs\n9. Agent Creation",
