      "updated": 1790058261589,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Is a web technology that enables a web server to push real-time,\nundirectional updates to the client over a single lived HTTP connection.\n\nThis allows the server to stream data as a series of events when they occur.",
