    {
      "id": "OCiCxJhMBjaCLZzvvvVUR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 106195.28547776041,
      "y": 10084.014265395575,
      "width": 2328.5986328125,
      "height": 325,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "c0HP",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1033585377,
      "version": 22,
      "versionNonce": 1873937556,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790058261590,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n1. The \"Autonomous B2B Sales SDR\" Agent\nThe Concept: An AI agent that doesn't just \"write\" emails, but finds leads, researches them, and writes highly personalized intro lines.\n\nHow it works: User inputs a niche (e.g., \"Dentists in Texas\"). The Agent scrapes Google Maps/LinkedIn, visits their website to read their \"About Us\" page, and generates a personalized cold email referencing specific details from their site.\n\nWhy Coders/Entrepreneurs will pay $30:\n\nThe \"Pain\" Point: Building a scraper + AI pipeline + email sender is a nightmare of integration work.\n\nThe Value: They can use this code to launch their own lead-gen agency or SaaS immediately.\n\nTech Stack: Next.js 15, Vercel AI SDK, Puppeteer (for scraping), OpenAI/Anthropic.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\n1. The \"Autonomous B2B Sales SDR\" Agent\nThe Concept: An AI agent that doesn't just \"write\" emails, but finds leads, researches them, and writes highly personalized intro lines.\n\nHow it works: User inputs a niche (e.g., \"Dentists in Texas\"). The Agent scrapes Google Maps/LinkedIn, visits their website to read their \"About Us\" page, and generates a personalized cold email referencing specific details from their site.\n\nWhy Coders/Entrepreneurs will pay $30:\n\nThe \"Pain\" Point: Building a scraper + AI pipeline + email sender is a nightmare of integration work.\n\nThe Value: They can use this code to launch their own lead-gen agency or SaaS immediately.\n\nTech Stack: Next.js 15, Vercel AI SDK, Puppeteer (for scraping), OpenAI/Anthropic.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "57PUd6HdflTwDbcinRAgO",
