      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790058261592,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Vector Search\n\nTechnique that use numerical embeddings or vectors to find similar data\n(text,images, audio)\n\nIt's a method of finding the \"nearest neighbors\" to a given query vector \nin the vector space.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Vector Search\n\nTechnique that use numerical embeddings or vectors to find similar data\n(text,images, audio)\n\nIt's a method of finding the \"nearest neighbors\" to a given query vector \nin the vector space.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
