      "updated": 1790058261594,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Nodes : what the agent does \n\n- Eges : how it moves between steps\n\n- State : What is remembers across steps",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
