      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Techstack : \n\n- Nodejs/TypeScript, Express (Gateway only)\n- gRPC\n- Docker\n- Docker Compose\n- MongoDB\n- Redis\n- RabbitMq\n- AI ocherstration (LangChain & LangGraph)\n- Vector databases\n- RAG (embeddings, retrievers, Prompt)\n- Design Memory Agent\n- Human in the Loop (HITL)\n- React/Tailwind Css\n- Microservices\n- gRPC",
